    {
      "id": "intro_4",
      "role": "Narrator",
      "text": "What conclusion does the author draw about noise and health in this piece?",
      "translation": "作者在这篇文章中对噪音与健康得出什么结论？",
      "startTime": 13.04,
      "endTime": 20.96,
      "analysis": {
        "words": [
          {
            "word": "What",
            "pos": "pron.",
            "meaning": "什么"
          },
          {
            "word": "This",
            "pos": "pron.",
            "meaning": "这，这个"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "intro_5",
      "role": "Narrator",
      "text": "Many people in industry and the Services,",
      "translation": "许多工业界和服务业人士，",
      "startTime": 20.97,
      "endTime": 24.91
    },
    {
      "id": "s1",
      "role": "Man",
      "text": "who have practical experience of noise,",
      "translation": "有噪音实际经验的人，",
      "startTime": 24.92,
      "endTime": 28.1
    },
    {
      "id": "s2",
      "role": "Woman",
      "text": "regard any investigation of this question as a waste of time;",
      "translation": "认为对此问题的任何调查都是浪费时间；",
      "startTime": 28.11,
      "endTime": 33.51,
      "analysis": {
        "words": [
          {
            "word": "This",
            "pos": "pron.",
            "meaning": "这，这个"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s3",
      "role": "Man",
      "text": "they are not prepared even to admit the possibility that noise affects people.",
      "translation": "他们甚至不准备承认噪音影响人类的可能性。",
      "startTime": 33.52,
      "endTime": 39.58,
      "analysis": {
        "words": [
          {
            "word": "Not",
            "pos": "adv.",
            "meaning": "不，不是"
          },
          {
            "word": "That",
            "pos": "pron.",
            "meaning": "那个"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s4",
      "role": "Woman",
      "text": "On the other hand,",
      "translation": "另一方面，",
      "startTime": 39.59,
      "endTime": 41.13
    },
    {
      "id": "s5",
      "role": "Man",
      "text": "those who dislike noise will sometimes use most inadequate evidence",
      "translation": "那些不喜欢噪音的人有时会使用最不充分的证据",
      "startTime": 41.14,
      "endTime": 46.04,
      "analysis": {
        "words": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s6",
      "role": "Woman",
      "text": "to support their pleas for a quieter society.",
      "translation": "支持他们对一个更安静的社会的诉求。",
      "startTime": 46.05,
      "endTime": 51.23,
      "analysis": {
        "words": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s7",
      "role": "Man",
      "text": "This is a pity, because noise abatement really is a good cause,",
      "translation": "这很遗憾，因为降噪确实是一个很好的事业，",
      "startTime": 51.24,
      "endTime": 57.24,
      "analysis": {
        "words": [
          {
            "word": "This",
            "pos": "pron.",
            "meaning": "这，这个"
          },
          {
            "word": "Is",
            "pos": "v.",
            "meaning": "是"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s8",
      "role": "Woman",
      "text": "and it is likely to be discredited if it gets to be associated with bad science.",
      "translation": "如果它与糟糕的科学联系在一起，它可能会失去信誉。",
      "startTime": 57.25,
      "endTime": 64.02,
      "analysis": {
        "words": [
          {
            "word": "It",
            "pos": "pron.",
            "meaning": "它"
          },
          {
            "word": "Is",
            "pos": "v.",
            "meaning": "是"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s9",
      "role": "Man",
      "text": "One allegation often made is that noise produces mental illness.",
      "translation": "一项经常被提出的指控是噪音会导致精神疾病。",
      "startTime": 64.03,
      "endTime": 69.77,
      "analysis": {
        "words": [
          {
            "word": "Is",
            "pos": "v.",
            "meaning": "是"
          },
          {
            "word": "That",
            "pos": "pron.",
            "meaning": "那个"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s10",
      "role": "Woman",
      "text": "A recent article in a weekly newspaper, for instance,",
      "translation": "例如，最近一份周报上的一篇文章，",
      "startTime": 69.78,
      "endTime": 74.07
    },
    {
      "id": "s11",
      "role": "Man",
      "text": "was headed with a striking illustration of a lady in a state of considerable distress,",
      "translation": "标题是一幅引人注目的插图，描绘了一位处于相当痛苦状态的女士，",
      "startTime": 74.08,
      "endTime": 80.71
    },
    {
      "id": "s12",
      "role": "Woman",
      "text": "with the caption 'She was yet another victim, reduced to a screaming wreck'.",
      "translation": "标题是“她是又一个受害者，沦为尖叫的残骸”。",
      "startTime": 80.72,
      "endTime": 88.21
    },
    {
      "id": "s13",
      "role": "Man",
      "text": "On turning eagerly to the text, one learns that the lady was a typist",
      "translation": "当人们急切地翻阅文字时，发现这位女士是一名打字员",
      "startTime": 88.22,
      "endTime": 93.75,
      "analysis": {
        "words": [
          {
            "word": "That",
            "pos": "pron.",
            "meaning": "那个"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s14",
      "role": "Woman",
      "text": "who found the sound of office typewriters worried her more and more",
      "translation": "谁发现办公室打字机的声音让她越来越担心",
      "startTime": 93.76,
      "endTime": 97.85,
      "analysis": {
        "words": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s15",
      "role": "Man",
      "text": "until eventually she had to go into a mental hospital.",
      "translation": "直到最后她不得不住进精神病院。",
      "startTime": 97.86,
      "endTime": 102.7
    },
    {
      "id": "s16",
      "role": "Woman",
      "text": "Now the snag in this sort of anecdote is of course that one cannot distinguish cause and effect.",
      "translation": "当然，这种轶事的问题在于人们无法区分因果关系。",
      "startTime": 102.71,
      "endTime": 110.44,
      "analysis": {
        "words": [
          {
            "word": "This",
            "pos": "pron.",
            "meaning": "这，这个"
          },
          {
            "word": "Is",
            "pos": "v.",
            "meaning": "是"
          },
          {
            "word": "That",
            "pos": "pron.",
            "meaning": "那个"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s17",
      "role": "Man",
      "text": "Was the noise a cause of the illness,",
      "translation": "噪音是导致疾病的原因吗",
      "startTime": 110.45,
      "endTime": 113.17
    },
    {
      "id": "s18",
      "role": "Woman",
      "text": "or were the complaints about noise merely a symptom?",
      "translation": "或者对噪音的抱怨仅仅是一种症状？",
      "startTime": 113.18,
      "endTime": 117.47
    },
    {
      "id": "s19",
      "role": "Man",
      "text": "Another patient might equally well complain",
      "translation": "另一位患者可能同样会抱怨",
      "startTime": 117.48,
      "endTime": 120.29,
      "analysis": {
        "words": [
          {
            "word": "Well",
            "pos": "adj.",
            "meaning": "健康的，良好的"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s20",
      "role": "Woman",
      "text": "that her neighbours were combining to slander her and persecute her,",
      "translation": "她的邻居联合起来诽谤她、迫害她，",
      "startTime": 120.3,
      "endTime": 124.91,
      "analysis": {
        "words": [
          {
            "word": "That",
            "pos": "pron.",
            "meaning": "那个"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s21",
      "role": "Man",
      "text": "and yet one might be cautious about believing this statement.",
      "translation": "然而，人们可能对相信这一说法持谨慎态度。",
      "startTime": 124.92,
      "endTime": 129.73,
      "analysis": {
        "words": [
          {
            "word": "This",
            "pos": "pron.",
            "meaning": "这，这个"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s22",
      "role": "Narrator",
      "text": "What is needed in the case of noise is a study of large numbers of people living under noisy conditions,",
      "translation": "在噪音的情况下需要的是对大量生活在噪音条件下的人进行研究，",
      "startTime": 129.74,
      "endTime": 137.16,
      "analysis": {
        "words": [
          {
            "word": "What",
            "pos": "pron.",
            "meaning": "什么"
          },
          {
            "word": "Is",
            "pos": "v.",
            "meaning": "是"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s23",
      "role": "Man",
      "text": "to discover whether they are mentally ill more often than other people are.",
      "translation": "发现他们是否比其他人更容易患精神疾病。",
      "startTime": 137.17,
      "endTime": 142.65,
      "analysis": {
        "words": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s24",
      "role": "Woman",
      "text": "Some time ago the United States Navy, for instance,",
      "translation": "例如，不久前美国海军，",
      "startTime": 142.66,
      "endTime": 146.75
    },
    {
      "id": "s25",
      "role": "Man",
      "text": "examined a very large number of men working on aircraft carriers:",
      "translation": "检查了大量在航空母舰上工作的人员：",
      "startTime": 146.76,
      "endTime": 151.99,
      "analysis": {
        "words": [
          {
            "word": "Very",
            "pos": "adv.",
            "meaning": "很，非常"
          },
          {
            "word": "Number",
