    },
    {
      "id": "s32",
      "role": "Woman",
      "text": "This result merely confirms earlier American and British studies:",
      "translation": "这一结果仅仅证实了早期美国和英国的研究：",
      "startTime": 184.41,
      "endTime": 189.98,
